---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import hero00 from '../assets/images/hero04.png';

const pageTitle = "About";
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle} heroImage={hero00} heroPosition="20% center">
  <section class="content">
    <h2>About</h2>

    <div class="profile">
      <p class="name">DAICHI ISHIZAWA</p>
      <p class="birth">東京生まれ</p>

      <p>
        頭の欠けた人形「空間人形」をモチーフに、立体・アッサンブラージュ作品を制作。<br />
        近年は生成AIも取り入れ、写真や映像などのビジュアル作品へと表現を広げている。<br />
      </p>

      <p>
        ヒトは、自らの頭を通して宇宙を知覚し、世界を認識している。<br />
        私たちが捉える世界は、知覚と認識によって形づくられ、そこには現実と虚像が重なり合っている。<br />
        頭を持たない「空間人形」は、そうした人間の認識の外側に存在する。<br />
        空間と時間、現実と虚像、人と人——さまざまなものの「間」を行き来しながら、人形たちは作品の中に現れる。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="profile en">
      <p class="name">DAICHI ISHIZAWA</p>
      <p class="birth">Born in Tokyo</p>

      <p>
        DAICHI ISHIZAWA creates sculptures and assemblage works centered on the motif of the "Kūkan Ningyō" (Spatial Doll), 
        a doll with a missing head. In recent years, the artist has also incorporated generative AI, expanding their practice into photography, video, and other visual works.
      </p>

      <p>
        Human beings perceive the universe and recognize the world through their own heads. <br />
        The world we grasp is shaped by perception and recognition, and within it, reality and image overlap.<br />
        The headless Spatial Doll exists outside the scope of such human recognition. <br />
        Moving between space and time, reality and image, one person and another, and among the many other things that lie "in between," the Doll appears throughout my work.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .content {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 3rem auto;
    padding: 0 3rem;
  }
  .content h2 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .profile {
    line-height: 1.9;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .profile .name {
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }
  .profile .birth {
  
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .profile.en {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #444;
  }
</style>
